"sourceCharacterId":"c10379"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/ef624514eaf9ed2c833924a25c7195e713f839051f84a358838be92514d6c695.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc625154d487c537ad36b04f50b3585c7d545dea3b3fa67af5b8f590c5b94051.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤脇 智之","creatorId":"vndb:s12642","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12642","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12642","name":"藤脇 智之","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:460","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4694","characterName":"柳楽 歌穂","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4694"},"originalCharacterName":"柳楽 歌穂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl in the same class as Ryou, she is the literary arts club president. She has a friendly personality, and she's very popular. She seems to be the quiet type, but when they were freshmen, she coerced Ryou into joining the club. She can be extremely forceful. She likes Ryou more than as just a friend, but she's going steady with his best friend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4694"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/efbfee14b73e9227375c1daf9c9c2d457fd471dc7d54a366db7f3be8234092c3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a87540072dcaac8ca6a2656991072fc47b60900f69741059b502cb2e54d7dd3.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鎌田 千歳","creatorId":"vndb:s197","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s197","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s197","name":"内川 藍維","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:459","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4695","characterName":"音羽 優佳","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4695"},"originalCharacterName":"音羽 優佳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A pretty girl in the same class as Ryou. She has a bright, outgoing personality, but she pretends like she doesn't care about anything. She either does this to piss people off, or she's just plain terrible at interacting with others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4695"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0cb960e542e3711829b94ae61d570bd20dd32aa38111768e8e86ada1c70b9859.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e977685c868e9f5eebd5dece37f1b7365980b028c36b6dda970ef554dc72689e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"矢沢 泉","creatorId":"vndb:s25","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25","name":"安田 未央","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:455","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4696","characterName":"佐々木 あやめ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4696"},"originalCharacterName":"佐々木 あやめ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ryou's stepsister. Ever since their parents were killed in a traffic accident, she has taken care of him. She really enjoys watching Ryou grow up, so much so that she has set any plans for herself by the wayside. It seems as though she isn't as interested in fads and fashions as most women her age are."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4696"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/260a760660c8d7dd76dcfadc9f215daa6936ede2c2a9e3090e8e66c1bace0194.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c6da08bc9ce52bcf8790f3af5a0632fc164fc4bf62749891a34a35e923d82b1b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一色 ヒカル","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:454","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4697","characterName":"芦原 杏子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4697"},"originalCharacterName":"芦原 杏子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Upon entering high school, she joined the literary arts club. Kyouko met Ryou when she joined, and it was love-at-first-sight. Usually, Kyouko seems a bit out in left field and doesn't show how she really feels. Being taller than most girls, she feels awkward about her height."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4697"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c0268c2dc07d6822bd7c31f7c3d6e8eb6dbc43faa96417770f4423e9cb0fb7e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b28103ab3f1d85517a49fb9fe3e39f663c678223f6864f6379e8a43a22ffc9df.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岬 友美","creatorId":"vndb:s128","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s128","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s128","name":"星野 千寿子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:457","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4698","characterName":"紫籐 香織","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4698"},"originalCharacterName":"紫籐 香織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"30"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The school nurse at Ryou's school. She got to know Ryou because he always comes to the nurse's office to take naps, but it appears she's known Ryou's sister Ayame for a long time. Kaori is beautiful, but she talks like a guy, so most people don't know how to react to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4698"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75c4faf4945cd0ff2830f338576e558f0c120eb5c071c961b412afdb2b1fda71.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/522348ee637c30f2f8069ead94ee380f8af0d81f40f5edfbfe5d159be33f9b3a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北都 南","creatorId":"vndb:s113","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s113","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s113","name":"ひと美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:456","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4699","characterName":"静原 美夢","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4699"},"originalCharacterName":"静原 美夢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Another third-year student. She is a talented pianist, and hopes to become a concert performer one day. She has a frail constitution and is often sick. Because of this, Miyu's only friends are Kaho and Ryou."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4699"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c9f6d57557eb1508cef0151bdf12b627fe5cd9a0d33dfa29a7b55764491bdd32.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3ab236ff7e2c410cae7bf7b670557b1d2ff37c6ab204726a1ee89f72e491a976.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐々 留美子","creatorId":"vndb:s194","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s194","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s194","name":"あおき さやか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:458","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4700","characterName":"佐々木 涼","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4700"},"originalCharacterName":"佐々木 涼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"His parents died three years prior to the story, causing him to live alone with his older step-sister, who is now his caretaker. Often scares others away with his sharp glares and antisocial demeanor. Is also quick to anger and has a foul mouth. Beneath the rough exterior lies a soft and kind personality, willing to do anything to help his friends."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4700"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e1fbdce066c55c9134ccfbd072bc0682ef304d94173edc1753c0cdd35c074071.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c1aad4af4015d34abb3a65a7221aa87c5af9cf6322efd05aa104121452c5ebd7.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6547","characterName":"藤堂 加奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6547"},"originalCharacterName":"藤堂 加奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taka's little sister. Because of renal insufficiency, she spends most of the time in the hospital. She does not have many friends, and is very dependent on her brother."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6547"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9eaea16caf373e37e66b4178be957ef5179dac116a2ed62eb4f4e1b55d9f014d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f7c7090203374d1e050b77bd563e5814068384614b502d0f5d7d7a0df8380098.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6548","characterName":"藤堂 隆道","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6548"},"originalCharacterName":"藤堂 隆道","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{